# Substation 9. Capture, restore a Dynamo, raise an Arc Sentry, field a Coil and a Lancer, destroy the Spire.
begin
capture 1
wait 25
build dynamo 1
build sentry 1
wait 160
produce coil
produce lancer
produce courier
wait 800
select coils
attack spire
select lancers
attack spire
select couriers
attack spire
wait 400
